{"title":"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace the letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the following expression with\nthe numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, without repetition:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f796614a43f9f855128fdef97e7c48c3d5f1212a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+\\cfrac{1}{b+\\cfrac{1}{c+\\cfrac{1}{d}}}\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"87\" />\nFind the difference between the maximum value and the minimum value of the expression.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the greedy algorithm, the maximum value will occur when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f98b3f405113241659d8c8db2ea3480346db4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. To maximize the fraction, we need to minimize the quantity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8febb713b64abfd61840415561812e0c175897e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + \\frac{1}{c + \\frac{1}{d}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"73\" height=\"43\" />, so we need to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. To minimize the remnants, we want to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50dbd06d5a86c506093e196f080ea8c7a2ee2a25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c + \\frac{1}{d}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"41\" height=\"37\" />, so we want to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/364e73f027e00a6cc83380babf2678597bba5df9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />; this leaves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd68fc9b0e901c556adb5c363357d3afbf1b4ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 2$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Following the same pattern of alternating maximums and minimums, the minimum value of the expression occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/c/ffc424e1107ce62ed953486adf7fc7c42745b228.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1, b = 4, c = 2, d = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p>Cleaning up the complex fraction, we get \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/d/cbdba16f0e3488c47dc5b7197704dfb0430c76d7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a + \\cfrac{1}{b + \\cfrac{d}{cd+1}} = a + \\cfrac{cd + 1}{bcd + b + d}\\]\" width=\"259\" height=\"64\" />\n</p><p>Substituting our values gives us that the maximum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0ba95f7bf6fc3755f5dcf0845a3e5c239f6c8a03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{43}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, while the minimum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a2b27c51e902a89a9a4225acfd88b933906c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{38}{31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" />. Subtracting, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce4a21665e514281af45b4e16c5f2baa02815c86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{991}{279}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"29\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC\" title=\"2005 PMWC\">2005 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T2\">Problem T2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T4\">Problem T4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I13\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I15\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem I15\">15</a> <br /> T: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T1\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T2\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T4\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T5\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T6\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T7\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T8\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T9\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T10\" title=\"2005 PMWC Problems/Problem T10\">10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017042650\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 161/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1654/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 124/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansio